Package: gft
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, curl, mawk | gawk
Recommends: gh, git, unzip
Suggests: xdg-utils
Description: fetch GitHub release info and assets from the command line
 gft shows release information, lists binary assets and downloads them
 from any GitHub project, without authentication. It reads the release
 pages directly, so there is no token to set up and no API rate limit.
